tudies in systemic lupus erythematosus. Series design</article-title><source>Arthritis Rheum</source><year>1980</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>153</fpage><lpage>157</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6965858</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/art.1780230204</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Peat</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>McCarney</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Croft</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Knee pain and osteoarthritis in older adults: a review of community burden and current use of primary health care</article-title><source>Ann Rheum Dis</source><year>2001</year><volume>60</volume><fpage>91</fpage><lpage>97</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11156538</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/ard.60.2.91</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Frankel</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Eachus</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Pearson</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Greenwood</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Peters</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Donovan</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name><name><surname>Dieppe</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Population requirement for primary hip-replacement surgery: a cross-sectional study</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1999</year><volume>353</volume><fpage>1304</fpage><lpage>1309</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10218528</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(98)06451-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10